    "title": "DARKER WAVES Fest 2026 lineup is here and it's stacked! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By THS ,\n1 days ago The Darker Waves Fest lineup for 2026 is finally out, and it feels like they really paid attention to what worked the first time around. Set for November 14 at Huntington State Beach, this year’s bill leans into that same mix of nostalgia and energy, but with even more variety across genres that shaped the last few decades. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
